  "description": "Skill dispatch and execution pipeline for Circle AI on-device agents — 2.0.2 adds skill-pack auto-import. SkillPackSource declares a remote pack (RepoUrl/GitRef/License/SkillSubdir); KnownSkillPacks ships 8 defaults (awesome-agent-skills, Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills, Privacy-Data-Protection-Skills, Claude-BugHunter, last30days-skill, eduba-brand, career-ops, build-your-own-x). HttpPackDownloader fetches GitHub tarballs under %LOCALAPPDATA%/CircleAI/skill-packs/; SkillPackAutoImporter orchestrates download + import with per-pack error isolation. Carries forward 2.0.1's SkillPackLoader. Version aligned with 2.0.2 SDK bundle.",
